<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">2 Timothy</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timothy</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Timothy</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timothy</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Timothy</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khris Jesu sunga om hinna kamciem tawh kizui-in Pasien’ deina tawh Khris’ sawltahpi ahi Paul in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pa Pasien le i Topa Jesu Khris tung panin hepina, khuotuona le lungmuonna in ka it ka tapa Timothy tungah hing tung taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka thungetna ah sun le zanin nang kang phaw zing ciengin, ka pu ka pate ma bangin lungsim siengtho tawh a na ka seppieh Pasien tungah lungdam thu ka tut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lungnopna tawh ka kidim thei nadingin na hlitui luonnate phawhkia-in kang mu ding kal ka ngahla mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lungsim tahpi tawh na upna ka phawh a, na pi Lois le na nu Eunice sungah tua upna na nungta masa-in, tu-in nang sungah ang nungta hi, ci thu ka theicien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam thu ziehin nangma tungah khut kang ngahna tungtawnin keima in na sunga a om Pasien’ letsong na kuontawkia ding kang phawhsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Pasien in meipuona lungsim ei pie sih a, vanglietna, itna, le ki-uh zawhna lungsim ei pie hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin i Topa’ thu tecipanna maizumpi loin, ama zieha thongkie ahi keima zong ei maizumpi sinlen, Pasien’ vanglietna tungah kingam kawmin lungdamna thu adinga ka genthei thuohna ah ei thuohpi zaw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in eite’ nasepna zieh hi loin ama’ ngimnasa bangin a hepina ziehin eite ei hundamin a siengtho hlatna tawh ei hlan hi. Tami hepina pen leitung pien masang Khris Jesu sunga ei piehsa ahi ta bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hizongle sina sumaimang a, lungdamna thu ziehin hinna le si thei lona a kilangsah i hundam pa Khris Jesu ang kilahna tungtawnin tu-in tua hepina ang kilang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tami lungdamna thu adinga a tangkopa, sawltahpi le siepa dinga ei kisesa ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tami thu hang tawh ka sep banga a thuoh ka hi hi. Hizongle ka mai a zum sih hi, bangzieh ahei cile ka up pa ka thei a, ama tunga ka silpiehte zong ama in khum Ni dongin ei keppieh zo ding hi, ci ka cienthei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima tung pana na zahsa thuhilna dihte, Khris Jesu sunga a om upna le itna sungah pomkip in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ei sunga a teng Hlagau Siengtho thahatna tawh nangma tunga ang ki-ap tua sil hoi kemcing in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asia gam sunga om zosie in kei ei taisan vua, tuate lahah Phygelus le Hermogenes-te zong kihal hi, ci thu na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Onesiphorus innkuonte tungah Topa in khuotuona pie taheh, azieh pen ama in ei thahatsah ngitnget a, ka thongkiehna zong ei maizumpi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rome ah ama ang tun ciengin keima ei sui-in ei mu pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khumi ni ciengin Topa kung panin ama in khuotuona a mu thei nading Topa in pie taheh! Ama in Ephesus khuo ah kei adingin bangza tahin ei seppieh ahei ci thu na theisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin nang ka tapa aw, Khris Jesu sunga om hepina sungah thahat in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />teci tampite tungtawnin kei tung pana na zahsa thute, midangte zong a hilsawn thei ding mi muonhuoite tungah na ap in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khris Jesu’ galkap hoi khat bangin hamsatna ei thuohpi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Galkap a sem lai mi koima in nisim vaite ah a kisawpawi sih hi; tua galkap pa’ lungtup in nasep a guon a bupa lungkimsah ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kidemna sungah a kihal mi koima in thuhlun tawh kituohin a dem sih leh lukhu a nga sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lohlo nasem pa in zong lo-a pieng gate a nga masah dinga a kilawm ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka thugen ngaisun in, bang ding ahei cile Topa in sil bangkimah theina ang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David’ suonlehlah ahi sina panin a thokia Jesu Khris phawh in, tua khu keima hil lungdamna thu ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tua thu ziehin gimna ka thuoh a, tuolthat khat bangin kolbulna cieng nangawn ka thuoh hi. Hizongle Pasien’ thu kol kibul thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin a teelsa mite in zong Khris Jesu sunga hutdamna le tawntung minthanna a ngaton thei nadingun amau’ ziehin sil bangkim ka thuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A muontah mama thu in: Ama tawh i siton uleh eite zong ama tawh i hington ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />eite in i thuohzawh uleh ama tawh zong i mangton ding uhi; eite in ama i niel uleh ama in zong eite ei niel ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />eite i muonhuoi sih uleh zong, ama a muonhuoi zing hi, azieh pen ama le ama ki niel thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam thu theisah inlen, thu ginalo, thu ngai mite a siesah thei bep ding kam kinielnate a pel nadingun Pasien mai-ah amate thuhil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Maizum om lo thuman thutah mantaha a gen, ama in a pahtat nasempa khat bangin Pasien tungah na ki-ap thei nadingin na thei tawpin bawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A thanghuoi a mawhna kamte na pel in, azieh pen tua bang thute in Pasien up lona lamah mite pui semsem ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a thugente uh zong a dam thei lo a bantawn hima bangin kizel ding hi. Tua bang mite lahah Hymenaeus le Philetus zong a kihal vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ama gel in thawkiana tung zo hi, ci-in thuman thutah panin pielin mi pawlkhatte’ upna a subuoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien’ khuombul kiptahin ding a, tam bangin kiciemte hi: “ Topa in ama-ate’ thei hi,” ci thu le, “ Topa mina a kilo mi zosie in gitlona panin kihemkhie heh,” ci thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Inn golpi khat sungah ngun le kham beh a om sih a, sing le lei tawh a kibawl vanzahte zong a om hi, pawlkhatte a thupi-a zah ding, pawlkhatte pen a kithangzah ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka gensa silte panin amau le amau a kisiensuo mi zosie pen nasep hoi namcin sem dingin a baisa-a om, inn neipa dinga kimanna a nei, a thupi-a zah dinga a ki-apsa vanzahte a suoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khangno lunggulnate pel inlen, lungsim siengtho panin Topa a hlan mite tawh dihna, upna, itna le kilemna del in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hizongle a mothuoi le theitel lopi-a kam kiselnate tawh na kicisaw kha sin; tuate in kihaunate piengsah hi, ci thu na theisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa’ nasempa pen mi tawh kihau poma lo ding a, tuale mahin mikim tungah a nunnem, thuhil lam a kiva, a lungduoi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />ama a langpang mite lungnemna tawh a hil mi hi ding hi. Pasien in amate kisiasahin thuman thutah theina pie theikha ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tuale dawimangpa’ thang panin ama’ deina lam sem dinga a matsa mite a suohta thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni nukhia ni ciengin hahsatna hun ang tung ding hi, ci theisiem in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Azieh pen mite ahile, amau le amau ki-itte, sum dei luote, a kipumphatte, a kihisahte, mi sietgente, nu le pa thu a mang lote, a lungdam thei lote, a siengtho lote,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />mihing lungsim a kuo lote, itna nei lote, a maisah nuom lote, mi gensiet hatte, sum thangzahte, a ngongtatte, thu hoi huote,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ciempelte, a gamhtatte, a kipum phatsahte, Pasien it ding sanga noptatna a lunggul zawte ahi ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a puthamin Pasien’ mi hina nei sam napi a vanglietna a nielte ahi ding uhi. Tua mite na pel in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate lahah mi pawlkhat kinelnelin mi inn ah lutin, a mawna zieh vua lunggulna namcin teng in a suhnawh a tonawh numei mawlawmte manin a thuzaw uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tua bang numeite ahi ule thu a kihilhil vangin thuman thutah a theitel zo ngai lote ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jannes le Jambres in Moses a langpan ma bangin tam mite in zong thuman thutah a langpang vua, lungsim kisie gawpsa le upna man lo mite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in ma a sot sih ding uhi, bangzieh ahei cile tua mi nite tungtang thu ma bangin amau’ motna zong mikim tungah kitheisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu-in nangma in ka thuhilna, ka gamtatna, ka nuntahna-ah ka lungtup, ka upna, ka lungduoina, ka itna, ka thuohzawh hatna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />bawlsietna ka thuohna, gimna ka thuohna, le Antioch, Iconium, le Lystra khuote ah keima tunga thupiengte na theisa uh ahi hi. Bawlsietna thuoh sam ing ei! Hizongle Topa in tuate zosie panin ei hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tahtahin, Khris Jesu sungah Pasien’ mi hinkhuo a mang nuom zosie pen a kibawlsie ding ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin migilote le misol hatte sie semsem ding a, midangte a sol bangun amate zong kisol ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin nang na hi leh koi kung pana na sin ahei ci na theisa ahi a, tua na sinsa le kiptaha na upsa silte zom peisuoh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesu Khris upna tungtawnin gupna na nga thei nadingin ang hil Lai Siengtho pen na neu lai-a kipanin bang na ci thei ahei ci thu zong na theisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lai Siengtho zosie Pasien’ humopsa hi a, thuhil nading, mi phawsiet nading, bawlphat nading, le dihna thu-ah mi pantah nadingin kimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua in sil hoi namcin a sem dingin Pasien’ mi zosie pantahin nasep a siem thei nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien mai le a hing laite le a site thukhen dinga ama ang kilaa nading le ama’ kumpi gam ngaisutna tawh Jesu Khris mai-ah lipkhap tahin kang hanthawn hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasien’ thu phuongzah in; hun a lemtang a, a lemtang sih zongin kin ngaisut den in; a thu telsah in, phawhin hanthawn inlen, lungduoi tawpna tawh hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile mite in kihilna man a ngai nop nawn lo uh hun ang tung ding a, bil thahin amau’ deina beh tawh a kituoh thuhil siete, amate adingin a kaikhawm ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />thuman thutah ngaina panin kihei mangin, phuotawm tangmite ngai-in a vahthap ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pilvang zing in, hamsatna thuoh bembom in, lungdamna thugen nasep sem inlen, tua na nasep a unpi-in muolsuo in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen kei ka hi leh dawnthei biehna banga sun dingin a kithawi sa-in ka om zo a, ka pei ding hun ang tung ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Galdona pha do zo-in, tai kidemna a mong dongin ka tai zo a, upna thu ka kemcing zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu-a kipanin kei adingin dihna lukhu kikoi zo a, tua ni ciengin a dih thukhenpa ahi Topa in keima ei pie ding hi, kei tung beh hi loin ama ang kilaa ding a lamen mi zosiete tungah zong a pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima kungah a mallang theithei-a nang haw nadingin hing hanciem ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen Demas in tami leitung a it ziehin keima ei taisanin Thessalonica khuo ah a pei zo hi; Galatia gamah Crescens ama pei zo a, Dalmatia gamah Titus pei zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Luke beh tawh a omton ka hi hi. Mark hing ciel inlen hing zawpi ta’n, bangzieh ahei cile ka nasepna ah ama kizang thei mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ephesus khuo ah Tychicus ka sawl zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang pei ciengin Troas khuo Carpus kunga ka nuasie ka puontuolpi, laibute zong, a diehdiehin savun laiziel zosie hing puo ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Siakhengpa Alexander in ei nah bawlsiet mama hi; a gamtatna bangin Topa in thuhkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in i thuhilna nahpi-in ei langpan ahi ziehin nang zong ama tungah na kidawm mama in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keima’ kihutna thu ka gen masah lai-in koima in ei panpi sih a, mi zosie in ei taisan sieng uhi. Tua thu ziehin amate kimawsah da kon heh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa in ei panpi a, keima tungtawnin Gentile-te zosie in tua thu a zah thei nadingin a bukima ka tangko nading thahatna ei guon hi. Tuaci’n humpi kam sung panin ei kihunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in gitlona tawh ei kidona namcin panin ei hunkhie ding a, ama’ vantung gam adingin ei hundam ding hi. Ama tungah kumtawnin minthanna om taheh. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Prisca, Aquila le Onesiphorus-te innkuon ei na noset pieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Corinth khuo ah Erastus tam suoh a, Miletus khuo ah Trophimus a cinasa-in ka nuasie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Phalbi masanga nang haw nading hing hanciem ta’n. Eubulus in nang ang noset a, Pudens, Linus, Claudia le sanggamte zosie in zong ang noset uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa le na hlagau hing om taheh. Note tawh hepina hing om taheh.
  </para>
</usx>
